00:41:22.681 --> 00:41:24.683
Move. go. go. go. go. go. go!

531
00:41:24.816 --> 00:41:27.018
- Go. go. go. go. go!
- Go. go. go. go. go.

532
00:41:28.554 --> 00:41:32.357
Come on. go. go. go. go. go!
Go. go. go. go. go!

533
00:42:01.252 --> 00:42:02.654
I confirmed.

534
00:42:23.909 --> 00:42:27.946
Son of a bitch! Goddamn it!

535
00:42:30.616 --> 00:42:32.751
Go smooth?

536
00:42:33.551 --> 00:42:35.587
As smooth as these things go.

537
00:42:35.687 --> 00:42:37.198
You got a lot of blood on your face there.

538
00:42:37.222 --> 00:42:38.456
Yeah. that's not mine.

539
00:42:38.590 --> 00:42:40.258
We debriefing?

540
00:42:40.358 --> 00:42:41.678
No. fuck no. Not here. we're not.

541
00:42:41.760 --> 00:42:43.037
We're getting the fuck out of here.

542
00:42:43.061 --> 00:42:44.963
Have everyone ready to move. 1800.

543
00:42:49.534 --> 00:42:53.304
Hey. brother. You got to get her
ready to travel. too.

544
00:42:53.404 --> 00:42:55.974
- Those motherfuckers.
- No.

545
00:42:56.107 --> 00:42:58.443
Get her ready to travel.

546
00:43:03.214 --> 00:43:05.316
Them handlers is
a different breed. aren't they?

547
00:43:05.416 --> 00:43:08.119
They're all a different breed.

548
00:43:09.087 --> 00:43:11.256
All right. let's police up all this shit.

549
00:43:11.356 --> 00:43:12.958
Let's get the fuck out of here.

550
00:43:13.058 --> 00:43:16.962
Exactly how are we
gonna do that. boss?

551
00:43:36.014 --> 00:43:38.416
That was pretty fucking nutty right there.

552
00:43:38.483 --> 00:43:41.519
We just killed a bunch of people
for a chess piece

553
00:43:41.653 --> 00:43:45.490
in a war that has nothing to do with us.

554
00:43:45.623 --> 00:43:46.925
Got something to do with us.

555
00:43:47.025 --> 00:43:48.894
They got SF and CIA all over the place.

556
00:43:48.994 --> 00:43:51.362
That's what I'm trying
to wrap my head around.

557
00:43:52.263 --> 00:43:54.499
It's not the place to talk about it.

558
00:43:56.367 --> 00:43:57.903
Where you going?

559
00:43:59.204 --> 00:44:00.906
I have no fucking idea.

560
00:44:01.006 --> 00:44:02.207
Do they have a place for us?

561
00:44:02.307 --> 00:44:05.576
Across the hall. they said.

562
00:44:11.016 --> 00:44:14.652
Seen a lot of crazy shit. boss.
What the hell?

563
00:44:14.753 --> 00:44:16.321
Not here. Bobby.

564
00:44:16.387 --> 00:44:18.790
Fucking robots and drones and shit.

565
00:44:18.857 --> 00:44:20.525
Not here.

566
00:44:22.360 --> 00:44:23.561
Do we have an exfil?

567
00:44:23.695 --> 00:44:27.465
Same way we came in. just backwards.

568
00:45:17.916 --> 00:45:19.617
- Hey. you're home.
- I am.

569
00:45:19.717 --> 00:45:22.087
- What time is it?
- It's late.

570
00:45:22.187 --> 00:45:26.257
Or... early.
depending on your perspective.

571
00:45:26.391 --> 00:45:28.459
- Okay.
- No. No. no. no.

572
00:45:28.559 --> 00:45:31.629
Don't get up. I just wanted
to see your face.

573
00:45:31.763 --> 00:45:33.231
- I'll be up in a minute.
- Okay.

574
00:45:33.298 --> 00:45:35.433
- Love you.
- Bye.

575
00:46:24.482 --> 00:46:25.783
Can I help you?

576
00:46:25.884 --> 00:46:27.085
We're with state police.

577
00:46:27.185 --> 00:46:28.629
Would you mind
stepping outside with us?

578
00:46:28.653 --> 00:46:30.333
I would mind very much.
What is this about?

579
00:46:30.421 --> 00:46:33.324
Please. step outside.

580
00:46:34.159 --> 00:46:35.260
What is this about?

581
00:46:35.326 --> 00:46:37.762
We need you to step outside.

582
00:46:37.863 --> 00:46:39.297
Yeah. I'm gonna need your name.

583
00:46:39.364 --> 00:46:40.607
your badge number.
your fucking watch commander.

584
00:46:40.631 --> 00:46:42.167
a warrant. and all sorts of shit

585
00:46:42.267 --> 00:46:44.435
I don't think either of you assholes have.

586
00:46:44.535 --> 00:46:47.538
Please. Ma'am.

587
00:46:48.539 --> 00:46:50.141
Outside.

588
00:46:50.976 --> 00:46:52.477
You're not the police.

589
00:46:52.543 --> 00:46:54.345
but you're two minutes
from meeting them.

590
00:47:13.865 --> 00:47:15.800
Fuck.

591
00:47:20.171 --> 00:47:22.807
I need FBI to my house
right now. I'm blown.

592
00:47:22.874 --> 00:47:24.375
and I have two down.
